      "content": "thanks for the info. the stomach thing is still kind of nagging me though, so i'm a bit nervous. u think the omeprazole is enough to keep my stomach safe while i take the advil? like, if i take them together won't the omeprazole basically block the ibuprofen from irritating my stomach? i don't really want to go to the doctor if i don't have to, it's a hassle.",
